  "adaptations": [
    "TypeScript to JSX without changing React/Vite",
    "Button and Input keep shadcn's structure (Base UI primitive, cva variants, data-slot, cn(variants(), className)); the cn-* class names of the registry are replaced by Tailwind 4 utilities with the ui: prefix that read the --ui-<component>-* variables componentVars writes from components.button / components.input / components.spinner of the store's theme",
    "shadcn's variant/size axes (default, outline, secondary, ghost, destructive, link; xs, sm, lg, icon...) are replaced by the theme's own: color and appearance of components.button, its sizes and its icon shape",
    "Input adds prefix/suffix slots (Icon), invalid and the theme's border_sides; Button adds loading and cta (components.button.base.cta_full_width)",
    "Dialog and Sheet keep shadcn's Base UI Dialog parts and API; values from components.modal and its close slot through componentVars on the portal element; Icon closeMd; Base UI Viewport to center; open and close transitions with data-starting-style/data-ending-style and the theme's motion; phone='sheet' is an own addition",
    "Checkbox.jsx and Choice.jsx both draw from the pinned checkbox.tsx and radio-group.tsx sources. Choice integrates them as an indicator for an interactive row."
  ],
  "limits": [
